<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔποψ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>view
				over,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ὅσον ἔ. τοῦ ἱροῦ εἶχε</span>
			so far as <i>the view from</i> the temple reached, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.64
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτὸς τῆς ἡμετέρας
			ἐ.</span> beyond our <i>range of vision.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				499d
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνώμαλον τὴν ἔποψιν τῆς
				ναυμαχίας ἐκ τῆς γῆς ἠναγκάζοντο ἔχειν</span> to
				<i>view</i> the seafight, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.71
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔποψίν τινος παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστὰς εἰς ἔ. τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐπόψει ἀλλήλοις</span>
			within <i>view,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.5.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oversight, superintendence,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. θεία περὶ τὸν κόσμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippod.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.39.26
			</span></i>.</div>
